  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/azizuysal/simtool/zipball/v1.3.1",
  "body": "## SimTool v1.3.1\n\nTerminal UI for browsing iOS simulators and Android emulators, apps, and files on macOS.\n\n\n### Fixed\n- Updated Go to 1.27.3 and `golang.org/x/net` to v0.62.0 to resolve vulnerability scan findings in the standard library and networking dependency.\n- Updated Bubble Tea to v2.1.1 to fix a vulnerability in terminal size reports.\n- Updated golangci-lint to 2.15.0 so local and CI lint checks support the patched Go toolchain.\n- Preserve the original emulator exit error when startup reporting and cleanup both wait for the process to finish.\n- Treat printable key bindings as text during search in all three list views, show the query in All Apps, and advertise only active search controls.\n- Initialize the Devices and All Apps platform filters and headings from `--platform`.\n\n\n## Installation\n\n### Homebrew\n```bash\nbrew install azizuysal/tap/simtool\n```\n\n### Direct Download\nDownload the appropriate archive for your system from the assets below and extract it.\n\n### From Source\n```bash\ngo install github.com/azizuysal/simtool/cmd/simtool@v1.3.1\n```\n\n---\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/azizuysal/simtool/compare/v1.3.0...v1.3.1\n\n"
